      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "DNG Brady are delighted to bring to the market this Grade A modern office /retail space in Drogheda town centre. The office / retail area is located on the ground floor of the MTI building on Drogheda's north side. The location is well served by amenities with banks, restaurants, cafés and shops within the surrounding area. In addition, the property benefits from being close to public transport facilities with 20 minute walk to the the train station and a 10 minute walk to Drogheda bus station. The property extends to an internal floor area of 161 m2 approximately and briefly comprises ground floor Grade A offices / retail space  to a very high specification and offering a large floor plate to provide for open plan and cellular offices, canteen and toilets."
      }
